### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey = my-secret-api-key-123

### ===========================
### Practice 3 - DI & Circular Dependency
### ===========================

### --- Part A: Notifications via Receipts ---

### 1. POST /receipts - Create a Receipt (saves to DB + logs [CORE EVENT] receipt_created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/receipts
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "issuedAt": "2026-03-24T10:00:00Z",
  "name": "Notebook",
  "price": 12.99
}

### 2. POST /receipts - Create another Receipt
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/receipts
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "issuedAt": "2026-03-24T11:30:00Z",
  "name": "Pen",
  "price": 2.50
}

### 3. GET /receipts - Verify receipts were created
GET {{baseUrl}}/receipts
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### --- Part B/C/D: Orders with Notifications (saved to PostgreSQL) ---

### 4. POST /orders - Create an Order (saves to DB + logs [CORE EVENT] order_created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "item": "Laptop",
  "quantity": 1,
  "price": 999.99
}

### 5. POST /orders - Create another Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "item": "Mouse",
  "quantity": 2,
  "price": 29.99
}

### 6. POST /orders - Create another Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "item": "Keyboard",
  "quantity": 1,
  "price": 79.99
}

### 7. GET /orders - Verify all orders saved in PostgreSQL
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders
